## Mensaje al usuario (plantilla)

Antes del push, mostrar:

```
✅ Pre-push gate (obligatorio antes de commit/push)
  - validate:pre-push: PASS/FAIL
  - dotnet build Release (si backend): PASS/FAIL/SKIP
  - frontend lint/format/typecheck/build (si frontend): PASS/FAIL/SKIP
  - frontend tests (si frontend): PASS/FAIL/SKIP
```

Solo tras PASS en todos los pasos aplicables → `git add` → `git commit` → `git push`.
